Package: com.ac3xx.lyricalizer
Name: Lyricalizer LRCLIB
Version: 1.4.2-lrclib1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Automatic lyric fetching in the classic Music app using the modern community LRCLIB API. iOS 5/6 compatible build; preserves embedded lyrics and caches fetched lyrics offline.
Maintainer: RaulKong89 community port
Author: ac3xx (original Lyricalizer), LRCLIB community backend
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 5.0), mobilesubstrate
Homepage: https://github.com/ac3xx/Lyricalizer
